 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yuFodWP6Eo4Q7kNvwFHSn9n&_nc_oc=AdpJdWxc44-0gOblUUsQbdcOzPYyooTCc5HlhrsPpTJoqPSGiw05qVO_hWBWfwOBctQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLVnkLAY_G5JAX3_R3PXwERPtM2qcdsAaHHAfANSBqfuA&oe=6AAC04C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l6jFZ2W6Ac8Q7kNvwEG_j3T&_nc_oc=AdqTmYTXcVAlgMTYaP-KfHp7m0Y0Wv_mV6RokkZqmXq4WFbyZBW0U7sbCf00xjD4V_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJtsjB26DIcVV08oLDqJq5HhRCktooYcbAvOgsNXIznrg&oe=6AABD9E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C1t_qXd4VLcQ7kNvwEc2B18&_nc_oc=AdqTZ7Srv3QMgYZF5mgJryjKc23Y23zB47RJN-ty0Se6BCN_MIHc5LpiXB8VILIneo4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKh4Jf00xfQeGakdcmfvoe0Iin-raRD9FC6hup-VqzAYA&oe=6AABE3DC"}, {"fil